      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. Describe the host in **Host** and the product in **Product**.\n3. In **Scene**, say what happens. `{{reference1}}` stands for the host and `{{image1}}` for the product.\n4. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        430,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        120
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedream 5.0 Lite draws the host from the waist up. `references`, what an earlier Dreamina step made, passes the portrait on to **Film** with no download or upload."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        120
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedream 5.0 Lite draws the product on a plain background. **Film** takes it from `images`, and the pack uploads it to your Dreamina canvas again, because `references` takes one connection."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1290,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        120
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.5 films the host holding the product, four seconds at `480p`, its smallest size, in a `9:16` frame. `model`, the model's name on Dreamina, is `seedance_2.5`. Two pictures alone would become the first and last frames, so `arguments` sets `mode` to `m2v`, the mode that uses them as references. **Scene** names them `{{reference1}}` and `{{image1}}`.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
